# "{T}: Add {U} or {R}." The color is chosen as the ability is activated, one each turn (blue, red); the other colors and
# colorless are refused beside those positive controls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swiftwater Cliffs
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swiftwater Cliffs.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Swiftwater Cliffs.Activate(Color: White)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Swiftwater Cliffs.Activate(Color: Black)
